  "details": "1. Open VRChat\n\n2. Tap your icon to view your own profile\n\n3. Tap \"Worlds\"\n\n4. Tap a private world\n\n5. Tap \"Instances\"\n\n6. It says \"No Instances\", with no interface for making any.\n\n7. Tap the back button\n\n8. Tap \"Worlds\"\n\n9. Tap a public world\n\n10. Tap \"Instances\"\n\n11. There's a \"Create Instance\" button this time.",
